      ],
      "en": "for they have opened the mouth of the wicked and the mouth of deceit against me. They have spoken to me with a lying tongue.",
      "ko": "대저 저희가 악한 입과 궤사한 입을 열어 나를 치며 거짓된 혀로 내게 말하며",
      "source_text_hash": "c5ae3bedfda833862bc90df9ff277b50f72d3e54f2a33bb0560b2eeb846637ca",
      "translation_text_hash": "901c42bf7ed0ad9fee2bc2735092d5c4cf2a9978a40163ea8a7309da00218c7d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "대저 저희가 악한 입과 궤사한 입을 열어 나를 치며 거짓된 혀로 내게 말하며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "901c42bf7ed0ad9fee2bc2735092d5c4cf2a9978a40163ea8a7309da00218c7d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:109:3",
      "sequence": 15759,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 109",
      "verse_label": "3",
      "locator": {
