      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 109,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "They have also surrounded me with words of hatred, and fought against me without a cause.",
      "ko": "또 미워하는 말로 나를 두르고 무고히 나를 공격하였나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "a198af399f77da99445e8833e201fc2570de96064780dedd78bcf7b42046f683",
      "translation_text_hash": "07b946e33796ce8a0b1ad62d065df98ea0969833ceab4e2ec9037234b0dc4c5a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "또 미워하는 말로 나를 두르고 무고히 나를 공격하였나이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "07b946e33796ce8a0b1ad62d065df98ea0969833ceab4e2ec9037234b0dc4c5a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:109:4",
      "sequence": 15760,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 109",
      "verse_label": "4",
      "locator": {
